#. <CLT 4>箱の中身は…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What was in the box...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>プレゼント風の楽しげな包装をされたからは、
#. 想像も付かなかった物…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It was wrapped up all nice, so I never would have\n"
"guessed what was inside...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>人の…骨…！！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Human bones...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この写真…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This picture...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんが子供の頃の…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's from when Kyoko was a little girl.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、そんな写真を、
#. ずっと持っているって事は…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Knowing the headmaster had this picture all this\n"
"time...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>きっと学園長は…霧切さんの事を…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>He must have really cared about her...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>他に…手掛かりになりそうな物はないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't see anything else that might be a clue...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この棚には…手掛かりはないみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's nothing in the filing cabinet that seems like\n"
"a clue...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0010 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0011 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
